<title>SPAIN: SOCCER-VALENCIA BEAT BESIKTAS 3-1 IN UEFA CUP.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-VALENCIA BEAT BESIKTAS 3-1 IN UEFA CUP.</headline>
<dateline>VALENCIA, Spain 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Valencia of Spain beat Besiktas of Turkey 3-1 (halftime 2-1) in their UEFA Cup third round first leg match on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Valencia - Goran Vlaovic 17, Ali Guncar own goal 23, Francisco Ferreira 82.</p>
<p>Besiktas - Oktay Derelioglu 33.</p>
